OL,3,GNEWSATheme park 'didn't expect' to win
OL,4,Aannual award
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn attraction where 27 people were
OL,7,Frecently rescued from a rollercoaster
OL,8,Fsaid it had not expected to win theme
OL,9,Fpark of the year.
OL,11,FPleasurewood Hills in Lowestoft,
OL,12,FSuffolk, has won had won the title for
OL,13,Fattractions with under one million
OL,14,Fvisitors in the UK Theme Park Awards.
OL,16,FLast month, the emergency services were
OL,17,Fcalled to the park when the Wipeout
OL,18,Fride broke down, leaving riders stuck
OL,19,Fon board for up to three hours.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
