OL,3,GNEWSATheme park 'didn't expect' to win
OL,4,Aannual award
OL,5,
OL,6,FFreddy Stokes, one of the owners of the
OL,7,Ftheme park, said it had not been an
OL,8,Faward "we were expecting to win" as
OL,9,Fthere was a lot more work to do on
OL,10,Fimproving the park.
